WEBVTT

01:04:59.181 --> 01:05:01.278
But I would say
our culture has messed us up.

01:05:01.302 --> 01:05:04.967
The word "altruism" was only invented
a few centuries ago.

01:05:04.991 --> 01:05:08.296
Once we invented the concept
that human beings are basically selfish,

01:05:08.320 --> 01:05:11.102
then we had to invent a word
for when they behave nicely.

01:05:11.126 --> 01:05:13.548
But before that,
being altruistic wasn't odd.

01:05:13.572 --> 01:05:14.818
It was just what you did.

01:05:14.842 --> 01:05:16.341
It was part of your community.

01:05:16.365 --> 01:05:18.574
We in America are
the most individualistic,

01:05:18.598 --> 01:05:19.962
so we're off on the extreme.

01:05:19.986 --> 01:05:24.245
And we have a social science model that
says we're all basically self-interested,

01:05:24.269 --> 01:05:27.665
which I think is partially
or largely untrue.

01:05:27.689 --> 01:05:33.496
CA: So, David, I like to ask everyone
who comes on this podcast,